<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley names COO for Indian operation.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley names COO for Indian operation.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Morgan Stanley said it had appointed Vikram Gandhi as chief operating officer of Morgan Stanley India.</p>
<p>Gandhi is currently executive direcor in the financial institutions group of Morgan Stanley's investment banking department based in New York. He will move to Bombay in January, reporting to Barry Hall, president of Morgan Stanley India.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
